{"type":"message","id":"15d015d4","parentId":"833881d3","timestamp":"2026-05-23T18:30:03.222Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-a…-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 23rd, 2026 - 6:30 PM (UTC)\nReference UTC: 2026-05-23 18:30 UTC"}],"timestamp":1779561003211}}
